sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as Client
  participant A as API
  participant D as platform.db
  participant K as Case system
  participant W as Outbox worker
  participant R as Webhook receiver

  C->>A: POST /v1/cases/{id}/escalate + Idempotency-Key, If-Match
  A->>D: Claim key, with a 30 s lease
  alt Key already completed
    D-->>A: Stored response
    A-->>C: Replay, Idempotency-Replayed: true
  else In progress, lease still held
    A-->>C: 409, retry shortly
  else New, or lease expired
    alt New, or nothing was attempted
      A->>K: Read case
      A->>A: Check account access, ETag and business rules
      opt Rejected: the write was not applied
        A->>D: Forget the key, audit the rejection
        A-->>C: 404, 409, 412 or 422 problem+json
      end
    else Earlier attempt may have applied the write
      A->>A: Skip checks, reuse the stored expected version
    end
    A->>D: Commit "upstream attempted" before the call
    A->>K: Transition, with external ID and expected version
    alt Applied or deduplicated
      K-->>A: Escalated case
      A->>D: One transaction: response, audit row, one outbox row per subscriber
      Note over A,D: If another holder already committed, return its stored response instead
      A-->>C: 200 + new ETag
    else Outcome unknown
      A->>D: Keep the record, release the lease, audit
      A-->>C: 502, 503 or 504. A retry resumes safely
    end
  end
  loop Every 500 ms, due rows of active subscriptions
    W->>D: Read due rows
    W->>R: POST, HMAC-signed. webhook-id is stable across retries
    alt 2xx
      W->>D: delivered
    else 410
      W->>D: Row dead, subscription inactive, its pending rows dead
    else Other failure
      W->>D: Back off and retry, dead after 8 attempts
    end
  end
